msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/index.rst:188
msgid ""
"Ascend fork of LayoutInference: VF regions are opaque to the worklist and "
"SIMT_VF bodies infer against the region's own lane scope."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/index.rst:194
msgid ""
"Ascend fork of LowerTileOp: VF region scopes, buffer-version key remap, and "
"no CUDA async-copy post-processing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/index.rst:202
msgid ""
"For every supported DMA copy this rewrites the copy to its in-bounds ranges; "
"for a padded GM->L1 copy it also appends semantic T.fill operations with "
"exact destination regions. Runs after InsertNd2Nz and before AutoSchedule so "
"each fill is scheduled as its own MTE2 task and ordered against L1->L0 "
"consumers. LowerTileOp later converts the fills to ascend_fill_l1, which "
"codegen emits as asc_fill_l1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/index.rst:214
msgid ""
"The resulting pairwise compatibility contract is consumed by :func:"
"`MergeUBAllocations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/index.rst:222
msgid ""
"AutoSchedule writes this contract during synchronization insertion. Manual "
"schedules must run :func:`InferBufferAliases` first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/index.rst:225
msgid "Buffer reuse is always performed unless ``disable_reuse`` is set."
msgstr ""

